meta {
  name: 06. Login with OTP
  type: http
  seq: 6
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login/otp
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "identifier": "{{seedUserEmail}}"
  }
}

vars:post-response {
  token: res.body.data.access_token
  refreshToken: res.body.data.refresh_token
  userId: res.body.data.user.id
}

docs {
  # Login with OTP

  **Method:** `POST`
  **Endpoint:** `/api/v1/auth/login/otp`
  **Auth:** None

  ## Description

  Passwordless login using a pre-verified email or mobile phone number. The backend automatically determines whether the identifier is an email or phone number at runtime.

  ## Request

  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `identifier` | `string` | Yes | Verified email address or mobile phone number |

  ## Response

  **`200 OK`**
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "user": {
        "id": 1,
        "name": "Default User",
        "email": "user@doratou.local",
        "phone": "09120000001",
        "is_email_verified": true,
        "is_phone_verified": true,
        "avatar_attachment_id": null,
        "system_role": "user",
        "status": "active",
        "wallet": 0
      },
      "access_token": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIs...",
      "access_token_expires_at": "2026-10-26T21:45:00Z",
      "refresh_token": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIs...",
      "refresh_token_expires_at": "2026-11-01T21:45:00Z"
    }
  }
  ```

  ## Errors

  * `400 Bad Request` — Missing identifier in request body
  * `403 Forbidden` — Identifier has not been verified with OTP, or account is deactivated
  * `404 Not Found` — User account not found
}
